        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngenxa yeSiyoni angiyikuthula, nangenxa yeJerusalema angiyikuphumula, kuze kuphume ukulunga kwalo njengokukhazimula, nokusindiswa kwalo njengesibani esivuthayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izizwe ziyakubona ukulunga kwakho, namakhosi onke inkazimulo yakho, wena ubizwe ngegama elisha oyakulibiza ngomlomo kaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyakuba ngumqhele okhazimulayo esandleni sikaJehova, nomqhele wobukhosi esandleni sikaNkulunkulu wakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawusayikubizwa ngokuthi unguSishiywa; izwe lakho alisayikubizwa ngokuthi ihlane, kepha uyakubizwa ngokuthi iHefiziba nezwe lakho ngokuthi iBewula; ngoba uJehova uyathokoza ngawe, lelizwe lakho lizathembeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba njengensizwa iganwa yintombi, kanjalo amadodana akho ayakuthatha wena; futhi njengoba umyeni ejabulela umakoti, kanjalo uNkulunkulu wakho uyojabula ngawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngimisile abalindi phezu kwezingange zakho, Jerusalema, abangayikuthula nanini imini nobusuku; nina enimbiza uJehova, ningathuli;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi ningamniki ukuphumula, aze alimise iJerusalema, alenze libe yindumiso emhlabeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova ufungile ngesandla sakhe sokunene nangengalo yamandla akhe, wathi: “Angisayikuzinika izitha zakho ukolweni wakho ube ngukudla kwazo; futhi amadodana wezihambi angaliphuzi iwayini lakho ozikhandlekele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa labo abakubuthayo bazakudla badumise uJehova; nabayibuthileyo bayoyiphuza emagcekeni ami angcwele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dlulani, nidlule emasangweni; lungisani indlela yabantu; lahlani, lahlani umgwaqo omkhulu; khiphani amatshe; phakamisa indinganiso kubantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhekani, uJehova umemezele kuze kube sekugcineni komhlaba: “Yishoni endodakazini yaseSiyoni ukuthi: “Bheka, insindiso yakho iyeza; bheka, inkokhelo yakhe inaye, uyasebenza phambi kwakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 62:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayakubabiza ngokuthi: Abantu abangcwele, abahlengiweyo bakaJehova; uyakubizwa ngokuthi: Ofuniweyo, umuzi ongashiyiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.62.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.62.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
